.el .ds Aq '
.TH tensor-wasm-man 1  "tensor-wasm-man " 
.SH NAME
tensor\-wasm\-man \- Generate roff(7) man pages from the clap command tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtensor\-wasm\-man\fR [\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate roff(7) man pages from the clap command tree
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fI<OUT_DIR>\fR
Output directory. When omitted, only the root `tensor\-wasm.1` page is emitted to stdout. When provided, every subcommand gets its own page written as `<binary>\-<subcommand>.1` (matching the established convention used by `git\-status.1`, `cargo\-build.1`, etc.)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
